      "created": 1789820609,
      "updated": 1789820616
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7a0",
      "text": "\t取ってきたか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7a1",
      "text": "\t入手",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7a2",
      "text": "\t生成",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7a3",
      "text": "\tつくったか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7a4",
      "text": "\t誕生",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7a5",
      "text": "\t由来",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7a6",
      "text": "\t",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7a7",
      "text": "\t---",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7a8",
      "text": "\tアバターで使ってる画像はどうやってつくった？的な書いてけ[しようとしたけど][力尽きた]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820714
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7a9",
      "text": "\t\tそしてアバターは画像なので「[頭痛が痛い]」感[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7aa",
      "text": "\t\t\t気分でブラケティングしたらもうあったｗ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7ab",
      "text": "\t\t[アイコンどうやって決めた？]というページがあったりする[kuuote.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7ac",
      "text": "\t\t けど体裁整った物が別にあってもいいのかもしれない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7eb2000000000094c7ad",
      "text": "\t\t 自分も書いてました（全く覚えてない）[sta.icon*2]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789820595,
      "updated": 1789820595
    },
